00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:32.550
included in this page. So this front end

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.309
is already looking pretty good. And if

00:03:34.319 --> 00:03:36.149
you were to go back like a few years ago

00:03:36.159 --> 00:03:37.670
or a few months ago, then you can

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.589
actually consider this as a fairly

00:03:39.599 --> 00:03:41.270
well-designed website. But obviously

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.710
you're in robo nuggets. We're going to

